XCOMM Imakefile for xm2089, the Motif frontend of 2089: the X way to build it,
XCOMM with the X installation's own compiler, flags and libraries.  Run
XCOMM xmkmf and make here, or xmkmf -a and make in the directory above to
XCOMM build every X frontend.
XCOMM
XCOMM (On AIX, imake's rules call the compiler cc_r: have /usr/vac/bin on
XCOMM PATH.)  The shared sources are linked in from the directories above,
XCOMM as imake does for sources kept elsewhere.
XCOMM
XCOMM Author: Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5), October 2026.
XCOMM MIT License; see LICENSE.

        DEPLIBS = XmClientDepLibs
LOCAL_LIBRARIES = XmClientLibs
       INCLUDES = -I. -I.. -I../.. -I../../..
           SRCS = motif.c xboard.c common.c 2089.c rng89.c
           OBJS = motif.o xboard.o common.o 2089.o rng89.o

AllTarget(xm2089)

LinkSourceFile(xboard.c,..)
LinkSourceFile(common.c,../..)
LinkSourceFile(2089.c,../../..)
LinkSourceFile(rng89.c,../../..)

NormalProgramTarget(xm2089,$(OBJS),$(DEPLIBS),$(LOCAL_LIBRARIES),NullParameter)
InstallProgram(xm2089,$(BINDIR))
DependTarget()
